# Cerulean City (FireRed's MUS_FUCHSIA, which Cerulean, Fuchsia and Bill's Sea Cottage share): an easy, flowing town
# theme in F, a clarinet-and-square melody over rippling broken chords, the water beside the town. Original
# composition for this game (plan 19 · K4).
